  "task": "R03 startup HUD regression fix",
  "recorded_utc": "2026-10-15T18:20:12.572228+00:00",
  "status": "FIXED_SHORT_DIAGNOSTIC_PASS; packaged full04 pending",
  "cause": {
    "observed": "Fresh standard 1152x720 with zero resize calls retained HUD height 1471px although settled combined minimum height was119px; the panel covered the projected player.",
    "mechanism": "Initial width/autowrap layout raised the Control minimum height. The prior size=(width,0) was clamped by that initial minimum and was never fitted after the minimum shrank. Later resize invoked layout and hid this startup defect.",
    "fix": "Set width while retaining height, then deduplicate a deferred height fit from layout/minimum_size_changed. Fit to actual settled combined minimum; no per-frame full-menu layout."
  },
